; XTRA
; Embedded .xtra Header
;
; General Info
; -------------------------------------------------------
; Residents       = "all.res"
; /XTRA
; a resident of the header without a path: Blitz3:BlitzLibs/Residents/all.res
; (its newtype ExecBase)
*e.ExecBase = Peek.l(4)
If *e\LibNode\lib_Version >= 36
  NPrint "ExecBase: Kickstart 2.0 or newer"
EndIf
NPrint "NEWTYPE size: ", SizeOf .ExecBase
End
